## REPORT BACK — increment 002 (render items, views.py only)

### 1. K2-1 fold half — the legend names `◆` only for DRAWN bands (CL-7)
- `_fold_keep` (views.py:5130) — the fold's band-selection extracted into ONE shared seat, called by both the renderer and the legend.
- `_kanban_grouped` (views.py:5102) now computes `band_rows`/`ids`/`room` and calls `_fold_keep` instead of the inline fold loop.
- `legend_entries` kanban branch (views.py:6746-6751) calls `_kanban_band_geometry` (:5184) + `_kanban_high_rows` (:5198) + `_fold_keep` and names the `◆` entry only for `drawn` band indices.

### 2. D-623 — a milestones-only project draws its rule-only band
- `kanban_plan` (views.py:4695-4726): the band loop now admits a project with no cards/no done when `band_milestones` returns items (project grouping, focus-respecting), and sets the head's `N open` to the open-milestone count for that band.
- `_kanban_grouped` (views.py:5047): the "no tasks" early-return now also checks `not plan.bands`.

### 3. UX2-2 — a late milestone below the fold marks the fold row
- `_kanban_grouped` (views.py:5122-5127) counts late milestones in `plan.bands[keep[-1]+1:]` and passes `late_ms` into `_fold_row`.
- `_fold_row` (views.py:5151) — down seat changed `▼ N below` → `▾ N more`; appends ` · ▲N ◆` when `late_ms` (views.py:5180-5181).

### 4. Milestones in lanes/agenda/focus (+ swimlanes legend)
